model c4_none
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the round's mutation run (book/adjust.rs measure_move, its guard on a hole-day instance that may exist): pn's day is a window row and its when is false at its law date, so it exists on no day: a1, known after the start, changes nothing that exists and makes no adjustment (C-4, E §5 step 1)"

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input d_at: date
input flag: bool

move pn: transfers
  on w
  at d_at
  when flag
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d_at = 2026-03-01 "s"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-25) "s"
  flag = false "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version a0
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"

version ax
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-02-01
  replace amt = 120.00 PLN "s"

version a_s
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-03-01
  replace amt = 130.00 PLN "s"

version a1
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-03-20
  replace amt = 150.00 PLN "s"

ask adj: count(a in adjustments over 2026-03 .. 2026-04)
ask adj_sum: sum(a.change for a in adjustments over 2026-03 .. 2026-04)
ask adj_k10: count(a in adjustments over 2026-03 .. 2026-04) as known 2026-03-10
ask adj_p05: sum(a.change for a in adjustments over 2026-03 .. 2026-04) with w = 2026-03-05
